{
  "text": "Here is how to take your saves to another PC with Kryoto Desktop. Cloud saves are a supporter perk, available as the feature rolls out.\n\nOpen Settings, then Cloud. Keep cloud saves and automatic backups switched on. Play your game, then close it. Desktop backs up the changed saves. Open the game's Saves card to check the last backup.\n\nOn your new PC, sign in to the same Kryoto account and install the game. With automatic restore enabled, newer cloud saves are restored before you play.\n\nIf both PCs have different progress, choose which saves to keep. Need an earlier backup? Open Versions and restore it while the game is closed.",
